	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d05_swleader5_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　りっぱな　たてものが
ワールドバトルトーナメントの▽
かいじょう！　どうだ！▼
じゃあ　おまえら　ついてこい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:47:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:47:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　立派な　建物が
ワールドバトルトーナメントの▽
会場！　どうだ！▼
じゃあ　おまえら　ついてこい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:48:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:47:56" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
･メッセージ表示後、ヤーコン、ライバル
　建物内に入る</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:47:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER5
ジムリーダー・ヤーコン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:36:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:46:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
