	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d05_swboss_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アクロマ『はなしは　きこえましたが
およしなさい▼
わざわざ　きけんなことに
くびを　はさむ　ひつようは　ない！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T08:36:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:57:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アクロマ『話は　聞こえましたが
およしなさい▼
わざわざ　危険なことに
首を　はさむ　必要は　ない！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T08:36:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:57:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・WBTから登場してメッセージ
・続けてswrival_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T08:36:04" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:36:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:58:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
